# 6 - Android Development — never commit signing material, secrets or build output.
# Created 2026-09-29 (Android import). This folder is NOT a git repo and NOT in repos.conf;
# this file protects any future `git init` / nested clone / sync of these trees.

# --- Signing / secrets ---
*.jks
*.keystore
*.p12
*.pem
keystore.properties
**/keystore/
local.properties
google-services.json
GoogleService-Info.plist
*.env
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
*recovery-codes*
SECRETS-INDEX.local.md
**/memory/test_credentials*

# --- Build output / caches ---
build/
.gradle/
.idea/
.cxx/
.externalNativeBuild/
captures/
node_modules/
__pycache__/
*.iml
.DS_Store

# --- Release artifacts (kept on the desk in <App>/Releases/, not committed) ---
*.apk
*.aab
Releases/
